    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first in the \u201cAnother World Series\u201d, in which the protagonist solves a mystery while moving between different worlds.<br><br>A legendary modern ghost story vs. a legendary horror game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the mystery of the abandoned hospital without bein</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Akashi Asanagi, a university student, wakes up on the 10th floor of an abandoned hospital.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While exploring the hospital, he encounters a blue monster called \u201cAooni\u201d, and when he touches the mask that Aooni dropped, the hospital transforms into an alley, where he encounters a mysterious woman wielding a kitchen knife called \u201cSlit Mouth Woman\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Akashi is attacked by the two beings, but for some reason a battle breaks out between the Slit Mouth Woman and Aooni...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >School, cemetery, house...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the various different worlds on each floor and use items and gimmicks to solve the mystery of the abandoned hospital.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-endings are unlocked depending on the results of your play, and each floor also has fully voiced event scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why are the Slit Mouth Moman and Aooni fighting? Who will win? Who is Akashi himself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer all 10 stages and escape from the abandoned hospital.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Main Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbAkashi Asanagi</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cheerful and slightly airheaded first year university student.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He finds himself in an abandoned hospital.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He has good reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbRay Yuyami</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite being in the fifth grade, she has a level of thinking and knowledge that puts adults to shame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She received a letter from her older sister, who ran away from home three years ago, and came to the abandoned hospital.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is quiet, but loves the occult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbMumu\u00a0Nissyoku</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl who is always smiling and carefree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Button (Left Click, Enter): Examine, decision</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >B Button (Right Click, Back Space): Cancel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Y Button (F): Use selected item</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X Button (Ctrl): Crouch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >L Bumper, R Bumper (Q, E): Select item</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >L Trigger, R Trigger (Z, C): Look back</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start/Menu (TAB): Open pause screen</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first in the \u201cAnother World Series\u201d, in which the protagonist solves a mystery while moving between different worlds.<br><br>A legendary modern ghost story vs. a legendary horror game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the mystery of the abandoned hospital without bein</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Akashi Asanagi, a university student, wakes up on the 10th floor of an abandoned hospital.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While exploring the hospital, he encounters a blue monster called \u201cAooni\u201d, and when he touches the mask that Aooni dropped, the hospital transforms into an alley, where he encounters a mysterious woman wielding a kitchen knife called \u201cSlit Mouth Woman\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Akashi is attacked by the two beings, but for some reason a battle breaks out between the Slit Mouth Woman and Aooni...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >School, cemetery, house...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the various different worlds on each floor and use items and gimmicks to solve the mystery of the abandoned hospital.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-endings are unlocked depending on the results of your play, and each floor also has fully voiced event scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why are the Slit Mouth Moman and Aooni fighting? Who will win? Who is Akashi himself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer all 10 stages and escape from the abandoned hospital.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Main Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbAkashi Asanagi</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cheerful and slightly airheaded first year university student.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He finds himself in an abandoned hospital.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He has good reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbRay Yuyami</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite being in the fifth grade, she has a level of thinking and knowledge that puts adults to shame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She received a letter from her older sister, who ran away from home three years ago, and came to the abandoned hospital.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is quiet, but loves the occult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbMumu\u00a0Nissyoku</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl who is always smiling and carefree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Button (Left Click, Enter): Examine, decision</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >B Button (Right Click, Back Space): Cancel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Y Button (F): Use selected item</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X Button (Ctrl): Crouch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >L Bumper, R Bumper (Q, E): Select item</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >L Trigger, R Trigger (Z, C): Look back</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start/Menu (TAB): Open pause screen</p>",
